# AI Routing Layer

A professional-grade, microservice-based LLM routing platform for routing OpenAI-compatible requests across multiple LLM providers with intelligent routing, comprehensive observability, and production-ready reliability.

## ✨ Features

- **🎯 Unified API Gateway**: Single OpenAI-compatible endpoint with comprehensive request validation
- **🔀 Intelligent Routing**: Dynamic provider selection based on cost, latency, and availability
- **🏥 Fault Tolerance**: Automatic retry logic, circuit breaker, and fallback routing
- **💰 Billing & Quotas**: Real-time usage tracking with cost calculation and quota enforcement
- **📊 Observability**: Prometheus metrics, OpenTelemetry tracing, structured logging
- **🔐 Security-First**: API key management, OAuth 2.0, rate limiting, audit logging
- **📈 Scalable**: Kubernetes-ready microservice architecture with horizontal scaling
- **🌍 Multi-Provider**: Built-in adapters for OpenAI, Anthropic, and extensible for others

## 🏗️ Architecture

The system is organized into **focused, independently scalable services**:

```
┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                         CLIENT LAYER                            │
│              (SDKs, Web UI, Curl, API Clients)                  │
└──────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────┘
                           │
┌──────────────────────────▼─────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    API GATEWAY SERVICE                           │
│        (Authentication, Rate Limiting, Validation)              │
└──────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────┘
                           │
┌──────────────────────────▼─────────────────────────────────────┐
│                   ROUTING SERVICE                                │
│      (Provider Selection, Dynamic Scoring, Circuit Breaker)     │
└──────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────┘
                           │
        ┌──────────────────┼──────────────────┐
        │                  │                  │
┌───────▼──────┐  ┌────────▼────────┐  ┌─────▼───────────┐
│ PROVIDER     │  │    PROVIDER     │  │   PROVIDER      │
│ SERVICE      │  │    SERVICE      │  │   SERVICE       │
│ (OpenAI)     │  │  (Anthropic)    │  │   (Custom)      │
└───────┬──────┘  └────────┬────────┘  └─────┬───────────┘
        │                  │                  │
        └──────────────────┼──────────────────┘
                           │
        ┌──────────────────┼──────────────────────────┐
        │                  │                          │
   ┌────▼────────┐    ┌────▼────────┐    ┌──────────▼──┐
   │  BILLING    │    │  AUTH       │    │OBSERVABILITY│
   │  SERVICE    │    │  SERVICE    │    │  SERVICE    │
   └─────────────┘    └─────────────┘    └─────────────┘
        │                  │                     │
        └──────────────────┼─────────────────────┘
                           │
        ┌──────────────────┼──────────────────┐
        │                  │                  │
    ┌───▼──────┐    ┌──────▼──────┐    ┌────▼──────┐
    │PostgreSQL│    │   Redis     │    │ Prometheus│
    │          │    │   Cache     │    │ + Grafana │
    └──────────┘    └─────────────┘    └───────────┘
```

