## 💻 API Examples

### Chat Completion

```bash
curl -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/chat/completions \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer dev-default-key" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
    "messages": [
      {"role": "user", "content": "Hello, what is AI?"}
    ],
    "temperature": 0.7
  }'
```

### Streaming Response

```bash
curl -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/chat/completions \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer dev-default-key" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
    "stream": true,
    "messages": [
      {"role": "user", "content": "Write a short poem"}
    ]
  }'
```

### Embeddings

```bash
curl -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/embeddings \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer dev-default-key" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "model": "text-embedding-3-small",
    "input": ["Hello world", "Goodbye world"]
  }'
```

## 🧪 Testing

```bash
# Run all tests
pytest tests/ -v

# Run specific test suite
pytest tests/unit/ -v
pytest tests/integration/ -v

# Run with coverage
pytest tests/ --cov=src --cov-report=html

# Watch mode (requires pytest-watch)
ptw tests/ -v
```

## 🔧 Configuration

### Environment Variables

```bash
# API Configuration
APP_NAME="AI Routing Layer"
DEBUG=false
LOG_LEVEL=INFO

# Database
DATABASE_URL=sqlite+aiosqlite:///./data/app.db  # SQLite for dev
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:pass@localhost/routing  # PostgreSQL for prod

# Redis Cache
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0

# Authentication
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Routing Configuration
ROUTING_CONFIG_PATH=./config/routing.yaml
```

### Routing Configuration (`config/routing.yaml`)

```yaml
models:
  - name: "gpt-4o"
    primary: openai
    fallbacks: [anthropic]
    timeout_ms: 30000

  - name: "claude-3-5-sonnet"
    primary: anthropic
    fallbacks: [openai]
    timeout_ms: 30000

routing_weights:
  cost: 0.4
  latency: 0.4
  availability: 0.2

providers:
  - name: openai
    type: openai
    base_url: https://api.openai.com/v1
    rate_limit: 3000

  - name: anthropic
    type: anthropic
    base_url: https://api.anthropic.com
    rate_limit: 2500
```

## 📊 Monitoring

### Prometheus Metrics

Available at: **http://127.0.0.1:9090**

Key metrics:
- `request_duration_seconds` - Request latency
- `request_total` - Total requests
- `provider_requests_total` - Requests per provider
- `billing_usage_tokens` - Token usage
- `cache_hit_ratio` - Cache efficiency

### Grafana Dashboards

Available at: **http://127.0.0.1:3000** (when using docker-compose)

Pre-built dashboards:
- System health overview
- Provider performance
- Billing metrics
- User usage trends

## 📁 Project Structure

```
ai-routing-layer/
├── src/ai_routing_layer/
│   ├── services/              # Microservices
│   │   ├── api_gateway/       # HTTP API endpoints
│   │   ├── routing/           # Routing engine
│   │   ├── providers/         # LLM provider adapters
│   │   ├── billing/           # Billing service
│   │   └── auth/              # Authentication
│   ├── shared/                # Shared libraries
│   │   ├── models/            # Data models
│   │   ├── exceptions/        # Custom exceptions
│   │   └── middleware/        # HTTP middleware
│   └── infrastructure/        # Infrastructure layer
│       ├── database/          # Database models
│       ├── cache/             # Caching layer
│       └── observability/     # Metrics, tracing, logging
├── tests/                     # Test suite
├── docs/                      # Documentation
├── web/                       # Frontend & dashboard
├── infra/                     # Infrastructure-as-Code
└── docker/                    # Docker configurations
```

## 🔐 Security

- ✅ API key authentication (hashed storage)
- ✅ OAuth 2.0 support (Google, GitHub, Apple)
- ✅ Rate limiting (per-key, per-user, per-IP)
- ✅ Request validation (Pydantic + JSON schema)
- ✅ CORS and CSRF protection
- ✅ Audit logging for all operations
- ✅ Secrets management (Vault/AWS Secrets Manager)
- ✅ Data encryption in transit (TLS 1.3)

## 📈 Performance

- **Throughput**: 10,000+ requests/sec per deployment
- **Latency**: P95 < 500ms (to external providers)
- **Availability**: 99.9% uptime SLA
- **Scaling**: Horizontal auto-scaling with Kubernetes

